{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"hasParentID","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","title":"hasParentID","externalID":"s:6Yorkie0A19_V1_TreeRestoreSpanV11hasParentIDSbvp","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"hasParentID","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/yorkie_v1_treerestorespan\/hasparentid"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan\/hasParentID","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns true if "},{"code":"parentID","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has been explicitly set."}],"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan/hasParentID":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"hasParentID","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns true if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"parentID"},{"type":"text","text":" has been explicitly set."}],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/yorkie_v1_treerestorespan\/hasparentid","title":"hasParentID","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan\/hasParentID"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan":{"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/yorkie_v1_treerestorespan","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"TreeRestoreSpan carries a tree node run from a single deletion, addressed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by TreeNodeID identity, for identity-preserving Tree undo\/redo. Unlike the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"text RestoreSpan (flat offsets), a tree span records the node’s structure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(type\/attrs) and its position anchors, because in a tree id-order is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sibling-order: left_sibling_id and right_sibling_id are redundant external"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"boundary anchors of the deleted run, so restore can reconstruct the run’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"internal order from the op’s own spans and needs only one surviving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"boundary to place it. value\/attributes are a deep copy so a GC-purged node"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can be recreated."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Yorkie_V1_TreeRestoreSpan","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie","title":"Yorkie","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie"}}}